<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<plugin>
  <name>Distribution Maven Plugin</name>
  <description>Maven distribution and packaging plugin with embedded scripts and @Override support</description>
  <groupId>io.github.mj-youn</groupId>
  <artifactId>distribution-maven-plugin</artifactId>
  <version>1.2.0</version>
  <goalPrefix>distribution</goalPrefix>
  <isolatedRealm>false</isolatedRealm>
  <inheritedByDefault>true</inheritedByDefault>
  <mojos>
    <mojo>
      <goal>package</goal>
      <description>표준 배포용 Zip 패키지를 생성합니다. (내장 스크립트 및 로컬 @Override 지원)</description>
      <requiresDirectInvocation>false</requiresDirectInvocation>
      <requiresProject>true</requiresProject>
      <requiresReports>false</requiresReports>
      <aggregator>false</aggregator>
      <requiresOnline>false</requiresOnline>
      <inheritedByDefault>true</inheritedByDefault>
      <phase>package</phase>
      <implementation>io.github.mj_youn.plugin.DistributionMojo</implementation>
      <language>java</language>
      <instantiationStrategy>per-lookup</instantiationStrategy>
      <executionStrategy>once-per-lookup</executionStrategy>
      <threadSafe>true</threadSafe>
      <parameters>
        <parameter>
          <name>project</name>
          <type>org.apache.maven.project.MavenProject</type>
          <required>true</required>
          <editable>false</editable>
          <description>MavenProject 인스턴스</description>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
          <name>appName</name>
          <type>java.lang.String</type>
          <required>false</required>
          <editable>true</editable>
          <description>패키징 및 스크립트 치환에 사용할 애플리케이션 이름</description>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
          <name>env</name>
          <type>java.lang.String</type>
          <required>false</required>
          <editable>true</editable>
          <description>활성화할 배포 프로파일 환경 (기본값: dev)</description>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
          <name>outputDirectory</name>
          <type>java.io.File</type>
          <required>false</required>
          <editable>true</editable>
          <description>패키지 산출물 디렉토리 (기본값: target)</description>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
          <name>extraDirs</name>
          <type>java.lang.String</type>
          <required>false</required>
          <editable>true</editable>
          <description>배포 패키지 루트에 함께 포함할 추가 디렉토리 목록 (공백 또는 콤마 구분)</description>
        </parameter>
      </parameters>
      <configuration>
        <project default-value="${project}" />
        <appName default-value="${project.artifactId}" />
        <env default-value="${env}" />
        <extraDirs implementation="java.lang.String">${extraDirs}</extraDirs>
        <outputDirectory default-value="${project.build.directory}" />
      </configuration>
    </mojo>
    <mojo>
      <goal>deploy</goal>
      <description>패키지 빌드 후 Zip을 자동으로 풀어 install_service.sh를 실행하여 서비스를 배포/구동합니다.</description>
      <requiresDirectInvocation>false</requiresDirectInvocation>
      <requiresProject>true</requiresProject>
      <requiresReports>false</requiresReports>
      <aggregator>false</aggregator>
      <requiresOnline>false</requiresOnline>
      <inheritedByDefault>true</inheritedByDefault>
      <implementation>io.github.mj_youn.plugin.DeployMojo</implementation>
      <language>java</language>
      <instantiationStrategy>per-lookup</instantiationStrategy>
      <executionStrategy>once-per-lookup</executionStrategy>
      <threadSafe>true</threadSafe>
      <parameters>
        <parameter>
          <name>project</name>
          <type>org.apache.maven.project.MavenProject</type>
          <required>true</required>
          <editable>false</editable>
          <description>MavenProject 인스턴스</description>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
          <name>appName</name>
          <type>java.lang.String</type>
          <required>false</required>
          <editable>true</editable>
          <description>패키징 및 스크립트 치환에 사용할 애플리케이션 이름</description>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
          <name>env</name>
          <type>java.lang.String</type>
          <required>false</required>
          <editable>true</editable>
          <description>활성화할 배포 프로파일 환경 (기본값: dev)</description>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
          <name>outputDirectory</name>
          <type>java.io.File</type>
          <required>false</required>
          <editable>true</editable>
          <description>패키지 산출물 디렉토리 (기본값: target)</description>
        </parameter>
      </parameters>
      <configuration>
        <project default-value="${project}" />
        <appName default-value="${project.artifactId}" />
        <env default-value="${env}" />
        <outputDirectory default-value="${project.build.directory}" />
      </configuration>
    </mojo>
    <mojo>
      <goal>help</goal>
      <description>배포 플러그인 사용 가이드 및 명령어 안내를 출력합니다.</description>
      <requiresDirectInvocation>false</requiresDirectInvocation>
      <requiresProject>false</requiresProject>
      <requiresReports>false</requiresReports>
      <aggregator>false</aggregator>
      <requiresOnline>false</requiresOnline>
      <inheritedByDefault>true</inheritedByDefault>
      <implementation>io.github.mj_youn.plugin.HelpMojo</implementation>
      <language>java</language>
      <instantiationStrategy>per-lookup</instantiationStrategy>
      <executionStrategy>once-per-lookup</executionStrategy>
      <threadSafe>true</threadSafe>
    </mojo>
    <mojo>
      <goal>distHelp</goal>
      <description>배포 플러그인 사용 가이드 및 명령어 안내를 출력합니다. (help alias)</description>
      <requiresDirectInvocation>false</requiresDirectInvocation>
      <requiresProject>false</requiresProject>
      <requiresReports>false</requiresReports>
      <aggregator>false</aggregator>
      <requiresOnline>false</requiresOnline>
      <inheritedByDefault>true</inheritedByDefault>
      <implementation>io.github.mj_youn.plugin.DistHelpMojo</implementation>
      <language>java</language>
      <instantiationStrategy>per-lookup</instantiationStrategy>
      <executionStrategy>once-per-lookup</executionStrategy>
      <threadSafe>true</threadSafe>
    </mojo>
    <mojo>
      <goal>initDeployScript</goal>
      <description>프로젝트 루트에 배포 자동화 쉘 스크립트(build_deploy.sh)를 생성합니다.</description>
      <requiresDirectInvocation>false</requiresDirectInvocation>
      <requiresProject>true</requiresProject>
      <requiresReports>false</requiresReports>
      <aggregator>false</aggregator>
      <requiresOnline>false</requiresOnline>
      <inheritedByDefault>true</inheritedByDefault>
      <implementation>io.github.mj_youn.plugin.InitDeployScriptMojo</implementation>
      <language>java</language>
      <instantiationStrategy>per-lookup</instantiationStrategy>
      <executionStrategy>once-per-lookup</executionStrategy>
      <threadSafe>true</threadSafe>
      <parameters>
        <parameter>
          <name>basedir</name>
          <type>java.io.File</type>
          <required>true</required>
          <editable>false</editable>
          <description>프로젝트 루트 디렉토리</description>
        </parameter>
      </parameters>
      <configuration>
        <basedir default-value="${project.basedir}" />
      </configuration>
    </mojo>
  </mojos>
</plugin>